=== Customizable Twilio WooCommerce SMS Integration ===
Contributors: informerfrk
Tags: twilio woocommerce, woocommerce sms, woocommerce sms notification, twilio, woocommerce twilio, twilio sms, twilio sms notification
Requires at least: 3.9.4
Tested up to: 5.2.1
Requires PHP: 5.2.4


== Description ==
Customizable Twilio WooCommerce SMS Integration plugin can send SMS from a WooCommerce store depending upon the order status using Twilio SMS API.

Buyers will get SMS notification for various types of order status such as after payment complete, after order complete, after order failed and for order processing.
The admin also will be able to get SMS notification when sale made on the store.

The plugin also has a pro version.
 
== Features of the free version of this plugin ==
Below are given the features of free version of this plugin:

* SMS notification when order processing. For example, a buyer will get SMS notification after order on cash on delivery.
* SMS after an order complete.
* SMS will be sent for order failed.
* Send SMS for the canceled order.
* All available types of SMS can be easily enabled/disabled from the plugin options page.
* SMS can be sent to both admin and buyer.
* Any type of SMS can be disabled/enabled for admin/buyer.
* All the SMS types available in the free version are customizable.
* You can use code like SITE_NAME, ORDER_CURRENCY, ORDER_TOTAL, ORDER_ID and it will be replaced with the value and name.

== Features of Pro version of this plugin ==
Pro version of this plugins holds some extra features. Below are the features that you will get in Customizable Twilio WooCommerce SMS Integration plugin:

* Contains all features of the free version.
* Send SMS when a buyer makes a payment. For example, the buyer will get SMS notification after making an online payment to buy a product on your WooCommerce store.
* Send SMS for refunded order.
* SMS will be sent when the order is on hold.
* Send SMS when the order is in pending.

The link to pro version of this plugin is available in the option panel of the free version of this plugin.

This plugin required the ACCOUNT SID and Twilio Token that you can get from [Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/).